# The mirror (level.h): booted stood up in the corridor (out 1300, facing out), turn round to face
# the hole you broke through. It's a mirror: the corridor again, reflected and tinted, two streaks
# of light across the glass, and you in it: a faceless figure. Walk up to it (your reflection
# grows), strafe (it follows), and look down at the reflected floor
wait_up
shot mr_00_stood
hold left 1.45
wait 0.5
shot mr_01_facing_the_mirror
hold r 0.35
hold up 1.6
wait 0.3
shot mr_02_nearer
hold up 0.5
wait 0.3
shot mr_03_near
hold up 2.5
wait 0.3
shot mr_04_at_the_glass
hold b 0.5
shot mr_04b_at_the_glass_looking_down
wait 1
hold l 0.4
wait 0.3
shot mr_05_strafed
hold down 0.6
wait 0.3
shot mr_06_backed_off
hold b 0.6
shot mr_07_look_down
